WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 074. THE LAW SAYS YES. Operations may still say no.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
MEASURE. ENACTMENT ≠ IMPLEMENTATION. Test affordability, workforce, equity, safety, outcomes.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
RULES. SOURCE. DATE. SCORE. WEIGHT. Expose every illustrative calculation.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
EVIDENCE. MISSING STAYS MISSING. Never substitute authorization for operations.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
BOUNDARY. DEMO ORDER ≠ REAL RANKING. Synthetic jurisdictions only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. COMPARE IMPLEMENTATION. Keep each readiness layer distinct.
